    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_version">Version %1$s · %2$d engine sounds</string>
    <string name="about_body">Electric motorbikes are almost silent, so other riders and pedestrians often don\'t notice you until you are right next to them. OmoZ plays a synthesized engine sound that follows your real speed, so people can hear you coming.</string>
    <string name="about_contribute_title">Contribute</string>
    <string name="about_contribute_body">OmoZ is open source. Add an engine sound in engine-core (docs/ADDING_ENGINE_SOUND.md), translate the app (res/values-xx), or add your phone\'s autostart screen in SystemSettings.kt. Render sounds on your computer with ./gradlew :engine-core:renderPreviews.</string>
    <string name="about_safety_title">Ride safely</string>
    <string name="about_safety_body">Keep the volume reasonable and follow local rules about vehicle sound. OmoZ is an awareness aid, not a replacement for a horn, lights or attentive riding.</string>
    <string name="about_licenses_title">Licenses</string>
    <string name="about_licenses_body">OmoZ — GNU AGPL-3.0-or-later, or a commercial license through the Komersial tier of GitHub Sponsors (see COMMERCIAL-LICENSE.md). Poppins font — SIL Open Font License 1.1. AndroidX / Jetpack Compose — Apache 2.0. Icons — Material Symbols (Apache 2.0) and original artwork. Not affiliated with OMOWAY.</string>

